# Ertai Resurrected: "Its controller draws a card" is the controller of the thing countered, whoever casts Ertai. Bot1
# casts a Lightning Bolt at Bot2 and, holding priority, flashes in Ertai to counter its own Bolt: Bot2 takes no damage and
# it is Bot1 that draws.

